{"format":1,"key":"zone:ragefire","path":"/lore/zone/ragefire","name":"Ragefire Chasm","kind":"dungeon","label":"Dungeon","zone":{"key":"ragefire","name":"Ragefire Chasm","path":"/lore/zone/ragefire"},"levels":"Levels 13-18","description":"Beneath Orgrimmar, Ragefire Chasm's volcanic tunnels shelter troggs and a demonic cult. The Searing Blade plots against the young Horde from caverns…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:ragefire","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Beneath Orgrimmar, Ragefire Chasm's volcanic tunnels shelter troggs and a demonic cult. The Searing Blade plots against the young Horde from caverns below the Cleft of Shadow, threatening the capital above.","Ragefire troggs erupt from deep beneath Orgrimmar into a maze of volcanic corridors and lava pits. As orcish builders raise their new home above, the troggs grow aggressive. Magatha Grimtotem sends Maur Grimtotem to open talks on Thunder Bluff's behalf, but the troggs slaughter the envoy. They yield only to force.","A demonic cult called the Searing Blade is more dangerous than the troggs. Loyal to the Shadow Council, the fanatics plot the young Horde's ruin from caverns beside streams of magma. The warlock Jergosh the Invoker, the cunning satyr Bazzalan, and the vicious felguard Taragaman the Hungerer lead them. Taragaman presides over an altar in the lava lake."],"hash":"72908f","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"773c04b463","sec":54},"female-narrator":{"sha":"b7cced78c0","sec":59}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Ragefire Chasm (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Ragefire_Chasm_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Ragefire Chasm","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Ragefire_Chasm"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/thrall","n":"Thrall","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/zone/orgrimmar","n":"Orgrimmar","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/cleft-of-shadow","n":"Cleft of Shadow","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/taragaman-the-hungerer","n":"Taragaman the Hungerer","k":"boss"},{"p":